 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "63ce0734-aad1-48c2-948c-f6ad0606132f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Run a pipeline adding a custom algorithm"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cdbd6fb8-f668-4a18-bbb7-f92a3bdf2172",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This process will run the entire pipeline described in a configuration file and will add a custom algorithm to it"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3219b25a-41f2-42af-b012-069534821d03",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Import dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 35,
   "id": "83709523-e070-4f02-842b-5f61c3f14b0e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "The autoreload extension is already loaded. To reload it, use:\n",
      "  %reload_ext autoreload\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "%load_ext autoreload\n",
    "%autoreload 2\n",
    "from paidiverpy.pipeline import Pipeline"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "faaf1514-8855-470e-a012-30f5001de7af",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Instantiate the Pipeline class"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "011674d7-972e-4aaa-a4cc-510133ae65d9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "When you instantiate the pipeline class, it will install some dependencies described in the configuration file that are necessary for the custom algorithm"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 36,
   "id": "46f413c1-b9a5-4dc1-a27d-9cba7f9c745c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "pipeline = Pipeline(config_file_path=\"../config_files/config_custom_algorithm.yml\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "803ad74e-ad2a-4e54-b93b-2a862a7d6612",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This occurs because of the following step that you added in the conf file:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "steps:\n",
    "    ...\n",
    "\n",
    "  - custom:\n",
    "      name: \"min_max_data\"\n",
    "      file_path: \"/mnt/noc/code/paidiver/paidiverpy/examples/custom_algorithms/custom_algorithm_example.py\"\n",
    "      class_name: \"MyMethod\"\n",
    "      dependencies:\n",
    "        - \"scikit-learn\"\n",
    "      params:\n",
    "        feature_range: (0, 1)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "In this case, you are saying that you need to install scikit-learn to use the custom algorithm"
   ]
  },
